# Keep the build context small, and — more importantly — keep host build output from overwriting
# what the image builds for itself. The previous .NET image had no .dockerignore, so `COPY Server/`
# dropped the host's obj/ on top of the container's freshly restored one, whose project.assets.json
# pointed at a NuGet path that doesn't exist in the image. The build failed with NETSDK1064.

